---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Savants — Your Infrastructure Savant">
<style>
  .hero { padding: 120px 0 80px; text-align: center; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .hero .accent { color: var(--accent); }
  .hero .subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 48px; }
  .install-box { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 32px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .install-box code { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--accent); }
  .install-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .terminal { background: #0d0d0d; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 28px; margin: 64px auto; max-width: 720px; text-align: left; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .terminal .prompt { color: var(--green); }
  .terminal .output { color: var(--muted); }
  .terminal .hl { color: var(--accent); }
  .terminal .warn { color: var(--yellow); }
  .terminal .err { color: var(--red); }
  .features { padding: 80px 0; }
  .features h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
  .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .tag-live { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); }
  .tag-code { background: #1e1b4b; color: #818cf8; }
  .tag-ai { background: #365314; color: var(--green); }
  .how { padding: 80px 0; text-align: center; }
  .how h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .steps { display: flex; gap: 32px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .step { flex: 1; min-width: 200px; max-width: 280px; }
  .step .num { display: inline-flex; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .step h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .step p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .cta { padding: 80px 0 120px; text-align: center; }
  .cta h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .cta p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); font-weight: 600; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1rem; }
  .btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 32px 0; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  footer a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
</style>

<div class="container">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Your infrastructure <span class="accent">savant</span></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">One command. Every layer. Know what's wrong in 60 seconds. Code graph + cluster state + log intelligence + host monitoring — all in one graph.</p>
    <div class="install-box"><code class="mono">curl -fsSL savants.sh | sh</code></div>
    <br/><span class="install-note">Then run <code class="mono">savants up</code> — that's it.</span>
  </section>

  <div class="terminal mono">
    <div><span class="prompt">$</span> <span>savants up</span></div>
    <br/>
    <div class="output">Starting Savants...</div>
    <br/>
    <div class="output">Detecting infrastructure...</div>
    <div class="output">&nbsp; Found K8s cluster: <span class="hl">production</span> (context: prod-us-east-1)</div>
    <div class="output">&nbsp; Found Docker</div>
    <div class="output">&nbsp; Found systemd</div>
    <div class="output">&nbsp; Found git repo: ./api-service</div>
    <br/>
    <div class="output">[host] 3 disks, 534 units (<span class="err">4 failed</span>), 42 journal events</div>
    <div class="output">[k8s]&nbsp; 94 pods: <span class="hl">61 Running</span>, 33 Succeeded</div>
    <div class="output">[k8s]&nbsp; Log intelligence: <span class="err">48 error templates</span> from 16 pods</div>
    <div class="output">[code] 500 functions, 159 classes, 1903 edges</div>
    <br/>
    <div class="output">Found <span class="err">3 issue(s)</span>:</div>
    <div class="output">&nbsp; 1. <span class="err">4 failed systemd units</span></div>
    <div class="output">&nbsp; 2. <span class="warn">42 journal error patterns</span></div>
    <div class="output">&nbsp; 3. <span class="err">48 error patterns across 16 pods</span></div>
    <br/>
    <div class="output">Run <span class="hl">savants story</span> for full diagnosis.</div>
  </div>

  <section class="features">
    <h2>Six layers. One graph. Every answer.</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><span class="tag tag-code">Code</span><h3>Code Property Graph</h3><p>AST-level call graphs, class hierarchies, decorator maps, config keys, string-literal references. Structural understanding, not text search.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag tag-live">Live</span><h3>K8s Cluster State</h3><p>Real-time watch streams with 1.3s propagation. Diff-based ingest. Pods, deployments, services, configmaps, secrets — live in the graph.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag tag-live">Live</span><h3>Log Intelligence</h3><p>3-tier pipeline: severity classifier, drain3 template extraction, graph nodes. 7.5M lines compressed to 78 actionable patterns.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag tag-live">Live</span><h3>Host Monitoring</h3><p>CPU, memory, disk, network, systemd, Docker, kernel events, journal errors. Full host story in 0.9 seconds.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag tag-ai">AI-Native</span><h3>26 MCP Tools</h3><p>Works inside Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf. Ask "what's wrong?" and get a graph-grounded answer, not a hallucination.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="tag tag-ai">AI-Native</span><h3>Cross-Layer Queries</h3><p>"This pod crashed because this configmap was edited, which is read by this code path, changed in this commit." One query.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="how">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Install</h3><p><code class="mono">curl savants.sh | sh</code> — single binary, zero deps.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Auto-detect</h3><p><code class="mono">savants up</code> finds K8s, Docker, systemd, git repos automatically.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Diagnose</h3><p>Ingests everything, runs log intelligence, tells you what's broken. 60 seconds.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <h2>Stop grepping. Start knowing.</h2>
    <p>Free forever for local use. No account required. No data leaves your machine.</p>
    <a href="https://savants.sh" class="btn">Install Savants</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p><a href="https://savants.dev">savants.dev</a> · <a href="https://savants.sh">savants.sh</a> · <a href="https://savants.cloud">savants.cloud</a></p>
  </footer>
</div>
</Base>
